ngoper", "ur": "وہ آپس میں لیتے دیتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা একে অপরকে হস্তান্তর করবে", "fa": "با یکدیگر کشمکش خواهند کرد"}}, {"text": "فِيهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَأْسًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَغْوٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِيهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَأْثِيمٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "20:62", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2410.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Then they debated one with another what they must do, and they kept their counsel secret.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Sihirbazlar aralarında işlerini tartıştılar ve konuşmalarını gizli tuttular", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو اپنے معاملہ میں باہم مختلف ہوگئے اور چھپ کر مشاورت کی،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka mereka berbantah-bantahan tentang urusan mereka di antara mereka dan mereka merahasiakan percakapan (mereka).", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَتَنَٰزَعُوٓا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/9b28a8acd60ebede8fcb.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa su raspravljali", "en": "so they disputed", "tr": "derken çekiştiler", "fr": "alors ils se sont disputés", "id": "maka mereka berselisih", "ur": "تو وہ آپس میں جھگڑ پڑے", "bn": "তখন তারা বিবাদ করল", "fa": "پس نزاع کردند"}}, {"text": "أَمْرَهُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بَيْنَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَأَسَرُّوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلنَّجْوَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "fo